                          QUERY PLAN                           
---------------------------------------------------------------
 Finalize Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Seq Scan on df_ty
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
 DataFusion: slice 0 eligible
 DataFusion: slice 1 not eligible: operator - on date and date
(7 rows)

